  description: Name: ForNova | Short Description: Market intelligence & visibility solutions for hotels | Detailed Description: ForNova is the provider of market intelligence and market visibility solutions for hotels. Its technology called SuperNova is a patented image-based scanning technology which scans, extracts and analyzes online hospitality data. Its offering is a two-tiered solution, a market intelligence product that allows hotels to collect and analyze all the available information from the market to check their hotels' pricing, ranking & distribution and a channeling and market visibility product that offers smart connectivity to the marketing channels so as to boost hotel bookings. Based in Israel with offices in London, Amsterdam, New York and Ukraine, the company claims to serve more than 13k hotels including brands such as Marriott, Hilton, NH Hotels, and Premier Inn. It has also developed Goldenfeeds for use to the online retailers. | Primary Sector: Consumer | Primary Subsector: Onl
